---

MCP is a new and developing standard. As with all new technology standards,
you should review the security of any systems that integrate with MCP servers,
such as MCP hosts, clients, agents, AI applications, and models and confirm
that they comply with system requirements, standards, and expectations. You
should follow Microsoft security guidance for MCP servers, including enabling
Entra ID authentication, secure token management, and network isolation. Refer
to Microsoft Security Documentation
(https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/api-management/secure-mcp-servers) for
details.

This MCP server may provide access to underlying resources, such as tools,
services, and/or data. Your use of that underlying resource via this MCP server
is governed by the underlying resource's license terms.
